#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100613 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/id #uuid "fe75d710-2f18-5ddb-9f93-3127d8cec7ed" :question/math-academy-id "e-4437" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\textbf{u}=\\langle 1,2 \\rangle$ and $\\textbf{v}=\\langle 3, -3 \\rangle.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043024/assets/f4b59236b774117dfc764389f3525a01c5f4c8429cece16552622f54cfb3d863.png)\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-3)-3\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $\\det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA = |{-9}| = 9\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100614 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/id #uuid "c824ba23-c39c-5205-81a3-98d2e4b823f3" :question/math-academy-id "e-4438" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\textbf{u}=\\langle 3,-2 \\rangle$ and $\\textbf{v}=\\langle 6, -4 \\rangle.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043024/assets/b25d71fb75afcb5e4f9e8ce137ec69fb1dfda54aa544b1636e11503273527844.png)\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-4)-6\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $\\det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA = |\\,0\\,| = 0\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268921 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13f5cda8-bdfc-5d85-838a-66fa58675f96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268923} {:answer/id #uuid "8772228e-9255-54ea-84f4-2407276340a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268924} {:answer/id #uuid "e5f7acdd-6986-5621-a928-60662fe5e229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268925} {:answer/id #uuid "1cd9010a-694a-5d20-ba4d-5db39864262a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268926} {:answer/id #uuid "9b802f4a-2c3d-5300-8e6e-a053bd38a55c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5f7acdd-6986-5621-a928-60662fe5e229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268925} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9fea1c1-ece9-5ee9-a22a-fc2ed323c176" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268922}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39a1bafc-9b8e-5f68-81b3-bc3b3cf59c38" :question/math-academy-id "q-13944" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043024/assets/7a70285258e584708a7296a2a008536dec9c97750b48e5fe0eb2f8cb7761bed1.png)\n\nCalculate the area of the parallelogram in the figure." :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-10\\,|=10\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268928 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b4344ad-bea7-591b-9d9a-9df93765c2d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268930} {:answer/id #uuid "dd3a11c5-b8fb-5f37-b8fa-32abeabab61a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "38" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268931} {:answer/id #uuid "77086d2f-6cf5-5165-a066-3de3857f04c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268932} {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268933} {:answer/id #uuid "9cb8f280-d04d-5ed7-8775-e4e765364d87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268934}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268933} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5822dda-c371-5b0e-b20e-832764f977ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268929}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7fe54472-016d-51ca-b2f6-6543f7ec9396" :question/math-academy-id "q-13951" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot 3-5\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,23\\,|=23\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186318430 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5eb4f8ac-f448-505c-83ef-e33d8fd513eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318432} {:answer/id #uuid "41a9d437-1f41-548b-8966-17a48ec425b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318433} {:answer/id #uuid "a14ac5ec-6ded-553c-b9b3-79dcd17e12f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318434} {:answer/id #uuid "c714f429-fbfa-5278-accb-1e6f02056a09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318435} {:answer/id #uuid "4e3b3f41-4b5c-5b1d-a606-a105396dce60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318436}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41a9d437-1f41-548b-8966-17a48ec425b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318433} :answer-field/id #uuid "a33be9ed-428d-5845-a7e8-423c36371f3d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318431}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "529d8005-e18f-5393-a462-f33e95fd4a29" :question/math-academy-id "q-13958" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨0,2⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨3,3⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0\\cdot 3-3\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-6\\,|=6\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186279110 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5401c01-9b40-5421-97da-b5d4e2ef05d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279112}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b5401c01-9b40-5421-97da-b5d4e2ef05d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279112} :answer-field/id #uuid "8bd562a1-de76-57bf-8a2a-0fff1c9df0c4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279111}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5b426326-b653-592b-bbad-842bee9a0bbe" :question/math-academy-id "q-320392" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043024/assets/6881c7b52de83103dcfc483ec25455781a4d399653e2369d28f6924327f8ee56.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨-3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨1,3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9-2 \\\\  & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-11|=11\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268935 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a11aae4e-eb2a-53b9-b729-aa97885f2131" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268937} {:answer/id #uuid "1666bef2-53dd-5816-8f00-565e6a60df13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318437}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a11aae4e-eb2a-53b9-b729-aa97885f2131" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268937} :answer-field/id #uuid "04afbf7d-4faa-596d-aa8f-7adff8c73e30" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268936}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "274e3fef-d560-53be-a236-cc5dab5cc853" :question/math-academy-id "q-320402" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,13\\,|=13\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186318438 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c32f8367-d095-5b0a-acdb-74ddb19bdabe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6\\sqrt{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318440}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c32f8367-d095-5b0a-acdb-74ddb19bdabe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6\\sqrt{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318440} :answer-field/id #uuid "ff815ddc-e32f-5769-b372-2373baad5c21" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318439}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6e4da092-ee77-55ed-836b-88264c9d0d79" :question/math-academy-id "q-320556" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=⟨3\\sqrt{2},\\,-\\sqrt{5}⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨a,\\,10⟩$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} & 10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} & 10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 10-a\\cdot (-\\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =30\\sqrt{2}+a\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}30\\sqrt{2}+a\\sqrt{5} & =0 \\\\ a\\sqrt{5} & =-30\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{10}}{5} \\\\ a & =-6\\sqrt{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268944 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} {:answer/id #uuid "355fc3ad-9f1d-52ab-8a17-d95b52098427" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268947}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} :answer-field/id #uuid "08592ac8-726f-534c-84c0-8a8e8dd42c78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268945}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f2a974ab-e642-5854-9835-4feb37d0563f" :question/math-academy-id "q-320557" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{2})\\cdot 6-a\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12\\sqrt{2}-3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12\\sqrt{2}-3a & =0 \\\\ -3a & =-12\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186289220 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5669635-9956-5e62-b8d3-ebc7c9ac5b32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289222} {:answer/id #uuid "5824f598-19e4-5f13-956f-26984dcfe33b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318441}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5669635-9956-5e62-b8d3-ebc7c9ac5b32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289222} :answer-field/id #uuid "82129578-1092-5512-bc14-e44ab2f9fbe3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289221}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e3d7e857-f860-5925-9b71-d1c2560557c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-320558" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-\\sqrt{7})(-10)-a\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{7}-5a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10\\sqrt{7}-5a & =0 \\\\ 5a & =10\\sqrt{7} \\\\ a & =2\\sqrt{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186318442 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "82708d50-9b75-5ab6-953d-fd8e7e464fff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318444} {:answer/id #uuid "0c3c279e-321f-502a-9f06-ca642f12c0e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318445} {:answer/id #uuid "cdb343e7-6744-57f7-95eb-b8163e9b56cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318446} {:answer/id #uuid "54fd7310-988b-54fd-86cc-5ad88ea5fddc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318447} {:answer/id #uuid "c2bb3e70-ec30-58a2-a509-af52654b0fdd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318448}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c2bb3e70-ec30-58a2-a509-af52654b0fdd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318448} :answer-field/id #uuid "c9264a88-2298-511f-a5ac-9b34c4534515" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-f